>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ABI-PROBE.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 PROBE-VALUES.
   05 PROBE-STATUS             PIC X(8) VALUE SPACES.
   05 PROBE-STATUS-LENGTH      PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 8.
   05 PROBE-RULE               PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
   05 PROBE-RULE-LENGTH        PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 10.
   05 PROBE-NET-CENTS          PIC S9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 PROBE-RETURN-CODE        PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE "PAYABLE " TO PROBE-STATUS
    MOVE "TEST-BR-01" TO PROBE-RULE
    MOVE 5000000000 TO PROBE-NET-CENTS
    PERFORM EMIT-PROBE

    MOVE "REFUND  " TO PROBE-STATUS
    MOVE "TEST-BR-02" TO PROBE-RULE
    MOVE -5000000000 TO PROBE-NET-CENTS
    PERFORM EMIT-PROBE

    GOBACK.

EMIT-PROBE.
    CALL "emit_assessment_json"
        USING BY REFERENCE PROBE-STATUS
              BY REFERENCE PROBE-STATUS-LENGTH
              BY REFERENCE PROBE-RULE
              BY REFERENCE PROBE-RULE-LENGTH
              BY REFERENCE PROBE-NET-CENTS
        RETURNING PROBE-RETURN-CODE
    END-CALL

    IF PROBE-RETURN-CODE NOT = 0
        DISPLAY "ABI probe failed with code " PROBE-RETURN-CODE
            UPON STDERR
        MOVE PROBE-RETURN-CODE TO RETURN-CODE
        GOBACK
    END-IF.

END PROGRAM ABI-PROBE.
